ledger={'status':'draft reviewed; native Danish review pending','source_basis':['Garnett novel as retained locally','Russian author preface and novel, ilibrary witness'],'repairs':['Grand Inquisitor is set in sixteenth, not fifteenth century.','Inheritance is disputed; Dmitri explicitly admits no remaining legal debt in Book III V.','Smerdyakov’s parentage is a suspicion, not an established birth record.','Hero identification is in author preface, absent from retained original; no longer wrongly attributed to narrative first sentence.','Removed unsupported claims about physical newspaper-folder handover, precise conversation history, superlatives, author psychology and biographical details.','Interpretations labelled as reading possibilities; characters not reduced to allegories.','Both opening excerpts now taken from corresponding current candidate.','Danish names, title and language modernized consistently.','Removed advance revelations of murderer, later hallucination and decisive outcomes from introductory cast.','Two inherited acclaim quotations withheld: exact primary quotations not verified. Restore only with primary source verification.'],'acclaim_primary_lead':'https://www.theparisreview.org/interviews/4954/the-art-of-fiction-no-12-william-faulkner','estimated_time_basis':'Approximate range for ~350,000 words at ~180–210 words/minute; reader pace varies.'}
(p/'GUIDE-REPAIRS.json').write_text(json.dumps(ledger,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n');print('Both guides saved; same top-level schema, 4 angles, 6 cast, 3 themes, no unverified acclaim quotes.')
